{
  "borough": "Harrow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;1&quot; type=&quot;1&quot;&gt;\r\n &lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-left: 5.35pt;&quot;&gt;The\r\n     proposed hours of use would result in increased levels of activity from a\r\n     restaurant use late into the evening, that would in turn generate adverse\r\n     noise impacts nearer to the quiet residential amenities of neighbours\r\n     within close proximity of the site. As such, the proposal would therefore\r\n     be contrary to Harrow Development Management Policies DM1 and DM 38A.b and\r\n     London Plan Policy D14.&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;1&quot; type=&quot;1&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;",
    "&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;1&quot; type=&quot;1&quot;&gt;\r\n &lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-left: 5.35pt;&quot;&gt;The local planning authority is\r\n     unable to undertake a detailed assessment of the development, as the\r\n     scheme has failed to provide sufficient information related to the\r\n     provision of artificial ventilation of the restaurant dining area to the\r\n     side and rear of the site. This thereby may result in the loss of\r\n     residential amenities to the surrounding properties due to undue\r\n     disturbance and also potential adverse visual impacts upon the character\r\n     and appearance of the Stanmore Hill Conservation Area and nearby listed\r\n     buildings from such infrastructure. It is considered that the imposition\r\n     of planning conditions would not provide satisfactory assurance to the\r\n     planning authority that these matters could be adequately dealt with and\r\n     would therefore be contrary to Harrow Development Management Policies DM1,\r\n     DM7 and DM 38A.b and London Plan Policies D4, D14 and HC1.&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top:0cm&quot; start=&quot;1&quot; type=&quot;1&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;"
  ],
